: RICOH_5A22-INIT ( -- )
  \ 初始化Ricoh-5A22设备
  ." 初始化Ricoh-5A22..." CR

  \ 初始化寄存器
  0 A!  \ Accumulator (8-bit, expandable to 16-bit)
  0 B!  \ Accumulator high byte when 16-bit
  0 X!  \ X Index Register (8/16-bit)
  0 Y!  \ Y Index Register (8/16-bit)
  0 SP!  \ Stack Pointer (8-bit, banked)
  0 PC!  \ Program Counter (16-bit)
  0 D!  \ Direct Page Register
  0 P!  \ Processor Status

